<title>USA: Northrim sets cash, stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Northrim sets cash, stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ANCHORAGE, Alaska 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northrim Bank president Marc Langland said the bank's Board declared a $0.05 per share cash dividend and a five percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be payable on January 30, 1997, for shareholders of record as of the close of business on January 20, 1997.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable on February 14, 1997, to shareholders of record on January 31, 1997.  Fractional shares will be paid in cash.</p>
</text>
